import IntegerMultBounds.Resampling.TabATape

/-! The off-diagonal weight table `tableE` on tapes: for each entry
`e = ℓ(2M+1) + j` with `h = j − M ≠ 0`, the exponent numerator
`α²((th + rr ℓ)² − rr(ℓ+h)²)` is formed without signs from `u = tℓ mod s`,
the carry `c = ⌊(2u+s)/(2s)⌋` (so `rr ℓ = u − sc`) and the magnitude
`|rr x| = u + sc − 2uc`; the zero offset is written as `0`. Generated by
`tabegen.py`. -/

namespace IntegerMultBounds.Resampling.TabETape

